        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Alina...!!!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "I didn't... want you to see me like this."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#8"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Don't talk. Alina, stop talking... Just don't talk!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "We need to stop the bleeding...! Just hang on...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "I'm... not bleeding anymore... It's just..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#9"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "In that case... Let's go! We need to get you to the medics right away for a blood transfusion!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "It's okay... Don't worry... It's just... the things I traded for..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#9"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Don't worry about those... They aren't important... Let's head back... I'll take you there!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Draco carries the Elafia on her back. Only now does she notice: this little deer looks so delicate and light, but her weight is so, so unbearably heavy on her back... As heavy as the weight of this whole world."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "Stop..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#9"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "I won't!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Who did it... Who did it... Who did this to you?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Was it the Patrol Unit...?! The villagers?! Those bastards... Those bastards... I'll burn them all... I..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Wait, don't tell me... Was it the Infected we exiled...?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Those ungrateful shitheads... No, no... If the Shieldguards gave them any rations..."
    },
