    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "Talulah...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Alina... I'm listening... Just tell me!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "I won't tell you...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Why?! Why?! Are you not going to at least give me the chance to avenge you?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "You mustn't... Don't you remember what you said to me yourself?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "You mustn't fight for revenge. You've already chosen, Talulah. You've already chosen a path to follow..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "Giving up halfway... all because of me...? I won't have it..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "Don't hold this against anybody... You mustn't."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "What are you talking about?! What are you saying?! How can I not...? How am I supposed to not hold this against anyone?!!!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "You told me yourself...! You said yourself that you can't harbor hatred against anyone... or you'd be... swallowed up... by that old man who placed that curse on you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "...Even if those Arts never existed in the first place... Wouldn't you still... be taken over... by all those things that represented who he was?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "You told me that yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Right... Right. But... But... Those people... Those..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "...You know where they came from... and why they did that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "You said it yourself... Those people... aren't our enemies..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Stop... Alina... Don't speak...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "No... Talulah... Everything you said... I remember... so you must remember yourself..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "These aren't the people... you need to crush... It's Ursus... That drove them into that corner..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "It's Ursus... and... the world as it is..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "It's okay... That's enough, Alina... I get it now!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "Talulah... There is one thing you can detest... Everything they did, you can scorn."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "But... never hate... anyone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "Do you agree with me...? Do you think what I said... is right? Are our lives... meaningful at all? Ugh... I don't know."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "I'm not sure what it was... that we did wrong... but I know very well just what that curse... is all about."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "Your rage... can burn down the entire plain... but you mustn't hate..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Alina..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
