    {
        "text": "The white-haired Draco keeps trudging on in the cold, endless snowfield. On her back, the Elafia girl trembles away, pausing only to take in deep breaths now and then."
    },
    {
        "text": "Snow drops down from the Elafia's horns. As Talulah slogs along, the snow-covered trees behind her begin to burn alight in silence. She has unknowingly begun to set her path ablaze."
    },
    {
        "text": "The snowfields before her eyes are vast and endless. On her back, Alina is the only warmth she can feel."
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah feels each and every beat of Alina's heart through her back, and they grow weaker and weaker by the moment."
